						<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="8cb376d2c35d63de" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="8c52ffd8f6d33b16">De oplossing is <ph id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/>.</target>
					</segment>
